Colour palettes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The "Clear Dark" and "Clear Light" themes reproduce the colour values of the
profiles of the same name shipped with Apple's Terminal.app, read from
/System/Applications/Utilities/Terminal.app/Contents/Resources/Initial Settings/.
Termina is not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple. The names are used to say
which palette is being reproduced.

