    GNU Bash, Z shell, fish, Ubuntu, Debian, Arch Linux, Fedora,
    Alpine Linux, openSUSE, Kali Linux, Linux (Tux)

Each mark remains a trademark of its respective project; they are used here only
to identify the shell or distribution a profile starts. Microsoft's marks
(PowerShell, Windows, Windows Terminal) have been withdrawn from Simple Icons
over trademark and are deliberately not reproduced — those profiles carry a
generic prompt glyph drawn for this project instead.
